@startuml
|User|
start
:Enter email and password;
|Web UI / API|
:POST /auth/login;
|Authentication & Access Control|
:Find account; check active and password hash;
if (Valid credentials?) then (yes)
  |Data Access Layer|
  :Store hashed session token and expiry;
  |Web UI / API|
  :Show dashboard;
else (no)
  |Web UI / API|
  :Show generic authentication error;
endif
stop
@enduml
